{
  "id": "799",
  "title": "Ben’s Diary - I Cried",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-10-03",
  "synopsis": "Ben went to see a movie because all of his friends said it was good.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1165/94fcbb2a0c74c9a2f7747f2e9c637116ee6a7a82.mp3?1634201877",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 5: You’re my best friend",
    "chapter": 7,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "本的日记——我哭了\n\n    今天，我去看电影，电影的名字叫《后来的我们》。我的朋友们都说，《后来的我们》很好看，看了会哭。\n    我去看了，看的时候，我没有哭。出电影院后，我哭了。\n    因为，我的车不见了！",
    "traditional": "本的日記——我哭了\n\n    今天，我去看電影，電影的名字叫《後來的我們》。我的朋友們都說，《後來的我們》很好看，看了會哭。\n    我去看了，看的時候，我沒有哭。出電影院後，我哭了。\n    因為，我的車不見了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben’s Diary – I Cried"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天，我去看电影，电影的名字叫《后来的我们》。",
      "traditional": "今天，我去看電影，電影的名字叫《後來的我們》。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ qù kàn diàn yǐng diàn yǐng de míng zi jiào hòu lái de wǒ men",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我的朋友们都说，《后来的我们》很好看，看了会哭。",
      "traditional": "我的朋友們都說，《後來的我們》很好看，看了會哭。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de péng you men dōu shuō hòu lái de wǒ men hěn hǎo kàn kàn le huì kū",
      "english": "Today, I went to see a movie. The movie’s title was “Us and Them”."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "All of my friends said “Us and Them” is very good, and you will cry from watching it."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我去看了，看的时候，我没有哭。出电影院后，我哭了。",
      "traditional": "我去看了，看的時候，我沒有哭。出電影院後，我哭了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ qù kàn le kàn de shí hou wǒ méi yǒu kū chū diàn yǐng yuàn hòu wǒ kū le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I went to see it, and when I was watching, I didn’t cry. After I left the movie theater, I cried."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "因为，我的车不见了！",
      "traditional": "因為，我的車不見了！",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi wǒ de chē bú jiàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Because, my bicycle was gone!"
    }
  ],
